{"5071800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carnage Mania", "steam_appid": 5071800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spot the Dog is young pup who was unfortunately turned into a specter  from hell when he took a bullet for his owner during the events of The Mysterious Planet. It is important that you welcome him with open arms during his return.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071800/extras/bf9fd946943307d68ac9fc09234e1acd.avif?t=1787942960\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnage Mania is a  fast-paced co-op  shooter where comedy, horror, and the spirit of early 2000's flash games come together... with a lot of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071800/extras/fd5615ef96007fa804fac78279ac44e2.avif?t=1787942960\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE THE DARK LORE SAGA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnage Lair Classic</strong> - A lone soldier investigates a  signal deep in space... finding The Mysterious Planet. Discover the Carnage Lair and the monsters led by the Wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnage Lair</strong> - Armed with upgraded gear, the lone soldier returns to The Mysterious Planet to uncover the truth behind the Wizard and its demonic basement hiding underneath the lair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnage Lair Nightmare</strong> - As the Carnage Lair's secrets are finally revealed, two twin operatives return years later to destroy the Wizard, burning the skulls of all monsters to craft Delightful Materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnage Tower</strong> - After the events of The Mysterious Planet, a demonic tower rises over Earth, starting the New Generation story. A young squad of soldiers battle their way through an ancient evil brought home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Carnage Tower</strong> - Shortly after the Carnage Tower event, a specter known only as Spot The Dog has come to play. He Will Find You During Your Play Session, He Does Not Bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071800/extras/9047a3c25e92d2b260dbf2081c0756a1.avif?t=1787942960\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN FOR ALL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced arcade runs with endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic stories and bonus modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op up to 4-players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live-action cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels for casual and veteran skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Spot the Dog is young pup who was unfortunately turned into a specter  from hell when he took a bullet for his owner during the events of The Mysterious Planet. It is important that you welcome him with open arms during his return.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5071800/extras/bf9fd946943307d68ac9fc09234e1acd.avif?t=1787942960\" width=